5504:
Ward,
As far as peeking wnd poking, that is no problem for ANY of the BASICs.
Even re-defining the characters is not a problem, providing you know what you want your end results to look like.
If you use one of the extended memory devices, an adventure game can be quite elaberate. If you are really creative, you can put multiple words together in a special character font or certain characters not normally used.
This sounds like a fun thing to do for anyone that has a background in BASIC.
Ken

