5541:
2 questions:
Do you have an electrical meter
Are you proficient at using it?
If you can answer yes to both, remove the top of your Arcade, and test the 4 pins where the power connector is while it is plugged in.
If you are not getting an AC voltage (not really high -about 18VAC on the 2 outer pins and 5-6VAC on the inner pins) WITH THE ON/OFF SWITCH OFF, on any pin, putting one probe on  the heat shield, your transformer is  is the culprit. If you get the proper voltages, them you have a problem with something inside the unit.
Ken

